  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Salty Sons | Luxury Vacation Rental in Inlet Beach, FL – Steps from 30A & Rosemary Beach<br><br>Discover Salty Sons, a stunning 4-bedroom, 3.5-bathroom luxury vacation home in the heart of Inlet Beach, Florida. Designed to host up to 10 guests in style and comfort, this professionally decorated retreat is perfectly situated near multiple beach access points, world-class dining, boutique shopping, and the iconic Rosemary Beach on 30A. Whether you're planning a family getaway, a couples' retreat, or a beach escape with friends, Salty Sons offers the perfect balance of elegance, convenience, and coastal charm.<br><br>Home Highlights:<br>- Accommodates up to 10 guests with 4 spacious bedrooms and 3.5 bathrooms<br>- Fully stocked gourmet kitchen with stainless steel appliances, large island seating, and dining space for family meals<br>- Multiple outdoor living spaces, including two private covered balconies with flat-screen TVs<br>- Luxury master suite with king bed and spa-style ensuite bathroom featuring a rainfall shower<br>- Comfortable layout with two guest bedrooms on the ground floor (queen bed + twin-over-full bunk) and additional queen bedroom on the third floor with bean bag sleeper<br>- Convenient full-size washer & dryer<br>- Starter amenities included: toiletries, paper products, laundry & dish soap<br><br>Outdoor & Entertainment<br>Unwind on the home's two expansive balconies, ideal for morning coffee or evening cocktails while watching the game on the mounted TVs. With seating areas designed for both lounging and entertaining, your group will love this seamless blend of indoor-outdoor living.<br><br>Prime Location<br>Salty Sons is located in one of the most desirable areas on the Emerald Coast, offering:<br>Rosemary Beach just minutes away for dining, shopping, and events<br>Three nearby public beach access points for endless sun and sand<br>Pier Park, Panama City Beach's premier shopping and entertainment hub, a short drive west<br>Camp Helen State Park less than 2 miles away for hiking, kayaking, and nature exploration<br>Easy access to Scenic Highway 30A for bike rides, coastal dune lakes, and charming beach communities<br><br>Parking<br>The home provides private parking for two vehicles in the driveway. Please note that street or grass parking is not permitted in this neighborhood.<br><br>Why Guests Love Salty Sons<br>From its luxurious interiors and thoughtfully curated amenities to its unbeatable location near 30A, Rosemary Beach, and Panama City Beach, Salty Sons is more than just a vacation rental—it's your personal escape to the Emerald Coast lifestyle.<br><br>✨ Book your stay at Salty Sons today and experience the perfect blend of luxury, relaxation, and coastal adventure.<br><br>Sleeping arrangements:<br>1st floor:<br>Bedroom 1 - Queen Bed<br>Bedroom 2 - Twin/Queen Bunk bed<br><br>3rd Floor:<br>Bedroom 3- Queen Bed<br>Bedroom 4- King Bed",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
